    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0446" n="388" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg388"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Señor Romero to Mr. F. W. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Unofficial]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 16,1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir</hi>: Fulfilling the offer I made you
                    some time since, to obtain authentic intelligence from my government about the
                    reported shooting of a son of the Marquis de Montholon, I wrote at once for that
                    purpose to Mr. Lerdo de Tejada, who has replied to me, contradicting that rumor,
                    as you will see in the letter (of which I send you a copy with this note) which
                    that gentleman sent me on the subject under date of 20th of October last.</p>
                <p>I remain your very respectful and obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. ROMERO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederick</hi> W. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c.,
                            &amp; c., &amp; c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d129-a1.xml" xpointer="d129-a1"/>
            </div>
